      "code": "// Value semantics with CoW backing: aliases remain isolated across appends, overwrites, and ping-pong.\nfunction testCoW() {\n  var a = [1, 2, 3];\n  var b = a;\n  b[0] = 99;\n  b[len(b)] = 4;\n  var c = a;\n  c[len(c)] = 10;\n  print(a);\n  print(b);\n  print(c);\n\n  // Ping-pong reads and writes between two branches.\n  var x = [0];\n  var y = x;\n  for (var i = 1; i <= 5; i += 1) {\n    x[0] = i;\n    y[0] = -i;\n  }\n  print(x[0]);\n  print(y[0]);\n\n  // Self-containment.\n  var orig = [1, 2];\n  var s = orig;\n  s[0] = s;\n  print(s);\n  print(orig);\n}\ntestCoW();",
